<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE WIN BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE WIN BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN, South Africa 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province beat Boland by six wickets on the fourth day of their Supersport series cricket match in Paarl on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Boland 204 and 237, Eastern Province 262 and 181-4 (Michael Beamish 76).</p>
</text>
